  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>The given series is an arithmetic progression whose first term is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>20</mn></math>&nbsp;and common difference is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>19</mn><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math>.</p><p>According to question,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>488</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mn>20</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>488</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>101</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2440</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn></math>&nbsp;or&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>40</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>40</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>40</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>22</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>For&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>61</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>61</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>61</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Thus,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mn>61</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p>",
